<!--
agreements/templates/agreement_document.html.j2

Rendered by agreements/pdf.py via WeasyPrint, same pattern as
property_intel/templates/property_location_report.html.j2 -- exact
HTML/CSS, no ReportLab, straight HTML->PDF so what you see here is
what prints.

Two render modes, one file (no second template needed):
  - render_mode == "document"    -> the actual legal document: letterhead,
                                     parties, clause body, signature block.
                                     This is what's emailed to the client
                                     and what they sign. Produced at SEND
                                     time from an unsigned Agreement, and
                                     again at EXECUTION time once signed
                                     (the signature block fills in) --
                                     Agreement.generated_pdf_url points at
                                     the latter.
  - render_mode == "certificate" -> a DocuSign-style "Certificate of
                                     Completion" -- the full AgreementEvent
                                     trail as a standalone, presentable
                                     document. Generated once
                                     Agreement.is_fully_executed is True.
                                     Agreement.certificate_pdf_url points
                                     at this.

Variables expected (all passed by agreements/pdf.py -- see that file for
the exact dict shape):
  render_mode, company_name, company_address, document_type_label,
  title, reference_id, generated_date, effective_date,
  client_name, client_company, client_email,
  content_html (pre-rendered, trusted, already merge-field-resolved --
    marked |safe below because it originates from staff-authored
    AgreementTemplate.body_html, never raw client input),
  governing_law, direction, confidentiality_term_months,
  requires_countersignature,
  signed_by_name, signed_by_title, signed_at, signed_ip, signature_method,
  countersigned_by_name, countersigned_by_title, countersigned_at,
  document_hash (short, for the footer -- NOT the full SHA-256),
  audit_events (list of {event_type, actor_name, actor_type, created_at,
    ip_address} -- only used in "certificate" mode).

Every field above is optional from the template's point of view -- a
field left unset renders its section as "—" or omits the block
entirely (see the signature block's "awaiting signature" state), it
never fakes a placeholder value. Matches the "never pad with N/A"
principle property_intel/pdf.py already documents for its own report.
-->
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>{{ title }}</title>
<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 26mm 18mm 22mm 18mm;
    @bottom-left {
      content: "Document ID: {{ reference_id }}" "  ·  Hash: {{ document_hash or '—' }}";
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #8a8f98;
    }
    @bottom-right {
      content: "Page " counter(page) " of " counter(pages);
      font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 7.5pt;
      color: #8a8f98;
    }
  }

  * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  body {
    font-family: 'Georgia', 'Times New Roman', serif;
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: #1a1d23;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .letterhead {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-start;
    border-bottom: 2.5pt solid #12213a;
    padding-bottom: 10pt;
    margin-bottom: 18pt;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .letterhead .company {
    font-size: 13pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #12213a;
    letter-spacing: 0.3pt;
  }
  .letterhead .company-address {
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-top: 2pt;
    max-width: 70mm;
  }
  .letterhead .doc-meta {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 8pt;
    color: #6b7280;
  }
  .doc-type-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #12213a;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.6pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 3pt 8pt;
    border-radius: 3pt;
    margin-bottom: 4pt;
  }

  h1.doc-title {
    font-size: 17pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #12213a;
    margin: 0 0 4pt 0;
  }
  .doc-subtitle {
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    color: #6b7280;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    margin-bottom: 16pt;
  }

  .parties {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14pt;
    margin: 14pt 0 18pt 0;
  }
  .party-box {
    flex: 1;
    border: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
    border-radius: 4pt;
    padding: 9pt 11pt;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .party-box .party-role {
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8f98;
    margin-bottom: 3pt;
  }
  .party-box .party-name {
    font-size: 10.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #1a1d23;
  }
  .party-box .party-detail {
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    color: #6b7280;
    margin-top: 1pt;
  }

  .terms-strip {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
    border-bottom: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
    margin: 14pt 0 18pt 0;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .term-cell {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 30%;
    padding: 8pt 10pt;
    border-right: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
  }
  .term-cell:last-child { border-right: none; }
  .term-cell .term-label {
    font-size: 7pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.4pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8f98;
    margin-bottom: 2pt;
  }
  .term-cell .term-value {
    font-size: 9.5pt;
    color: #1a1d23;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .clause-body {
    margin: 16pt 0 24pt 0;
  }
  .clause-body h2 {
    font-size: 11.5pt;
    color: #12213a;
    margin: 16pt 0 6pt 0;
  }
  .clause-body p {
    margin: 0 0 9pt 0;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .clause-body ol, .clause-body ul {
    margin: 0 0 9pt 20pt;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .signature-section {
    margin-top: 26pt;
    page-break-inside: avoid;
  }
  .signature-section .section-heading {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 8pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8f98;
    border-bottom: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
    padding-bottom: 4pt;
    margin-bottom: 12pt;
  }
  .signature-blocks {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16pt;
  }
  .sig-block {
    flex: 1;
    border: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
    border-radius: 4pt;
    padding: 12pt;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .sig-block.executed {
    border-color: #1e7a4c;
    background: #f4faf6;
  }
  .sig-block.pending {
    border-color: #d8dce3;
    background: #fafbfc;
  }
  .sig-block .sig-role {
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.5pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8f98;
    margin-bottom: 8pt;
  }
  .sig-block .sig-name {
    font-family: 'Georgia', serif;
    font-size: 15pt;
    font-style: italic;
    color: #12213a;
    border-bottom: 0.75pt solid #1a1d23;
    padding-bottom: 6pt;
    margin-bottom: 6pt;
    min-height: 20pt;
  }
  .sig-block .sig-title { font-size: 8.5pt; color: #1a1d23; }
  .sig-block .sig-meta { font-size: 7.5pt; color: #8a8f98; margin-top: 4pt; line-height: 1.5; }
  .sig-block .sig-pending-label {
    font-size: 9pt;
    color: #b45309;
    font-style: italic;
  }

  .integrity-note {
    margin-top: 14pt;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 7.5pt;
    color: #8a8f98;
    border-top: 0.75pt solid #d8dce3;
    padding-top: 8pt;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  /* ── Certificate mode ────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .certificate-heading {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 22pt;
  }
  .certificate-heading .cert-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    background: #1e7a4c;
    color: #ffffff;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 8pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.6pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    padding: 4pt 10pt;
    border-radius: 3pt;
    margin-bottom: 8pt;
  }
  .certificate-heading h1 { margin: 0; }

  table.audit-trail {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 8.5pt;
    margin-top: 10pt;
  }
  table.audit-trail th {
    text-align: left;
    font-size: 7pt;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.4pt;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8f98;
    border-bottom: 1pt solid #12213a;
    padding: 6pt 8pt;
  }
  table.audit-trail td {
    padding: 7pt 8pt;
    border-bottom: 0.5pt solid #e5e7eb;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  table.audit-trail td.event-type { font-weight: 700; color: #12213a; }
  table.audit-trail td.event-meta { color: #8a8f98; font-size: 7.5pt; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

{% if render_mode == "certificate" %}

  {# ── Certificate of Completion ─────────────────────────────────── #}
  <div class="letterhead">
    <div>
      <div class="company">{{ company_name or "Scape" }}</div>
      <div class="company-address">{{ company_address or "" }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-meta">
      <div>Generated {{ generated_date }}</div>
      <div>Ref: {{ reference_id }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="certificate-heading">
    <div class="cert-badge">Certificate of Completion</div>
    <h1 class="doc-title">{{ title }}</h1>
    <div class="doc-subtitle">{{ document_type_label }} — fully executed record</div>
  </div>

  <div class="parties">
    <div class="party-box">
      <div class="party-role">Party — {{ company_name or "Scape" }}</div>
      <div class="party-name">{{ countersigned_by_name or "—" }}</div>
      {% if countersigned_by_title %}<div class="party-detail">{{ countersigned_by_title }}</div>{% endif %}
      {% if countersigned_at %}<div class="party-detail">Countersigned {{ countersigned_at }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="party-box">
      <div class="party-role">Party — Client</div>
      <div class="party-name">{{ client_name }}</div>
      {% if client_company %}<div class="party-detail">{{ client_company }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="party-detail">{{ client_email }}</div>
      {% if signed_at %}<div class="party-detail">Signed {{ signed_at }}{% if signed_ip %} from {{ signed_ip }}{% endif %}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>

  <table class="audit-trail">
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width:18%;">When</th>
        <th style="width:20%;">Event</th>
        <th style="width:22%;">Actor</th>
        <th>Detail</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for event in audit_events %}
      <tr>
        <td class="event-meta">{{ event.created_at }}</td>
        <td class="event-type">{{ event.event_type }}</td>
        <td>{{ event.actor_name or event.actor_type }}</td>
        <td class="event-meta">{{ event.ip_address or "" }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="integrity-note">
    This certificate is a system-generated record of every action taken on
    document {{ reference_id }} from creation through execution. It is
    appended for audit purposes and is not itself a signed legal
    instrument — the executed agreement is the document identified above.
    Content integrity hash: {{ document_hash or "—" }}.
  </div>

{% else %}

  {# ── The actual agreement document ─────────────────────────────── #}
  <div class="letterhead">
    <div>
      <div class="company">{{ company_name or "Scape" }}</div>
      <div class="company-address">{{ company_address or "" }}</div>
    </div>
    <div class="doc-meta">
      <div class="doc-type-badge">{{ document_type_label }}</div><br>
      <div>Ref: {{ reference_id }}</div>
      <div>Generated {{ generated_date }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <h1 class="doc-title">{{ title }}</h1>
  <div class="doc-subtitle">
    Effective {{ effective_date or "on the date of last signature" }}
    {% if governing_law %} · Governed by {{ governing_law }}{% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="parties">
    <div class="party-box">
      <div class="party-role">Disclosing / Contracting Party</div>
      <div class="party-name">{{ company_name or "Scape" }}</div>
      {% if company_address %}<div class="party-detail">{{ company_address }}</div>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="party-box">
      <div class="party-role">Client</div>
      <div class="party-name">{{ client_name }}</div>
      {% if client_company %}<div class="party-detail">{{ client_company }}</div>{% endif %}
      <div class="party-detail">{{ client_email }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {% if direction or confidentiality_term_months or governing_law %}
  <div class="terms-strip">
    {% if direction %}
    <div class="term-cell">
      <div class="term-label">Disclosure Direction</div>
      <div class="term-value">{{ direction }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if confidentiality_term_months %}
    <div class="term-cell">
      <div class="term-label">Confidentiality Term</div>
      <div class="term-value">{{ confidentiality_term_months }} months post-termination</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if governing_law %}
    <div class="term-cell">
      <div class="term-label">Governing Law</div>
      <div class="term-value">{{ governing_law }}</div>
    </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  {% endif %}

  <div class="clause-body">
    {{ content_html | safe }}
  </div>

  <div class="signature-section">
    <div class="section-heading">Signatures</div>
    <div class="signature-blocks">

      <div class="sig-block {{ 'executed' if signed_at else 'pending' }}">
        <div class="sig-role">Client</div>
        {% if signed_at %}
          <div class="sig-name">{{ signed_by_name }}</div>
          {% if signed_by_title %}<div class="sig-title">{{ signed_by_title }}</div>{% endif %}
          <div class="sig-meta">
            Signed {{ signed_at }}{% if signature_method %} · {{ signature_method }}{% endif %}<br>
            {% if signed_ip %}IP {{ signed_ip }}<br>{% endif %}
            On behalf of {{ client_company or client_name }}
          </div>
        {% else %}
          <div class="sig-name">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="sig-pending-label">Awaiting signature</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>

      {% if requires_countersignature %}
      <div class="sig-block {{ 'executed' if countersigned_at else 'pending' }}">
        <div class="sig-role">{{ company_name or "Scape" }}</div>
        {% if countersigned_at %}
          <div class="sig-name">{{ countersigned_by_name }}</div>
          {% if countersigned_by_title %}<div class="sig-title">{{ countersigned_by_title }}</div>{% endif %}
          <div class="sig-meta">Countersigned {{ countersigned_at }}</div>
        {% else %}
          <div class="sig-name">&nbsp;</div>
          <div class="sig-pending-label">Awaiting countersignature</div>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      {% endif %}

    </div>

    <div class="integrity-note">
      This document was generated and, where signed above, executed
      electronically via {{ company_name or "Scape" }}'s agreement system.
      Document integrity hash: {{ document_hash or "pending — assigned at signature" }}.
      A full signing history is available as a separate Certificate of
      Completion once this document is fully executed.
    </div>
  </div>

{% endif %}

</body>
</html>
